          "text": "Product information\n\nPrepare product facts and references before shaping a review angle and short-form video.\n\nOpen guide",
          "href": "/docs/marketplace-capture"
        },
        {
          "text": "Capture product information\n\nUse the Chrome Extension with Shopee or TikTok Shop, review the captured details, and sync approved product material into the workspace.\n\nOpen guide",
          "href": "/docs#marketplace-capture"
        },
        {
          "text": "Worker App and local rendering\n\nConnect a local runtime for render jobs, queue visibility, progress, and the production work that needs a client machine.\n\nOpen guide",
          "href": "/docs#worker-render"
        },
        {
          "text": "MCP and connected AI clients\n\nUnderstand the permissioned MCP path for Claude, Codex, Hermes, and other compatible clients before connecting advanced workflows.\n\nOpen guide",
          "href": "/docs#mcp-integrations"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open the quick start",
